# steps/free-names.md (class C): char has no conversion to size_t -- the caller's char k where peek returns a size_t
# is refused at the value as the same char declared in peek is.  Before M2: "internal: a conversion site was not
# checked".
fn: peek () size_t
    return: k
fn: m () size_t
    char: k 'a'
    return: peek()

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
